     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Prenatal and newborn visits — Newborn Hx:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " the HPI can incl the mother's preg and the infant's status @ birth; Social Hx focuses on family struct, and FHx on congenital anomalies and hereditary disorders."
     }
